    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.02_typed_legs_and_atlas.sections.04_diagram_inventory_table.concrete_anchor_2#twistedarrow_joc_s850" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_02_typed_legs_and_atlas_sections_04_diagram_inventory_table_concrete_anchor_2#twistedarrow_joc_s850 silm:hasLongDescription "The TwistedArrow_JoC_S850 is the twisted-arrow category Tw(C) from JoC 8.50; instantiates BodyMass-quality vs. WeighingProcedure non-identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TwistedArrow_JoC_S850', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
